	(text "8-PIN PASS-THROUGH: pin 5 intercepted; pins 6/7 share GND.\nPin 4 and pin 8 designations require radio/cable verification."
		(at 25.4 73.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c34a8dd5-3469-4496-83a7-ec41e2af395b")
	)
	(text "RC FILTER: 151.4 Hz tone; nominal PWM 10 kHz. DIVIDER is loaded by final level control."
		(at 25.4 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5c50b326-19a3-475e-9e07-e5e703f7269c")
	)
	(text "OFF-BOARD UI: pin order follows specification. Switches close to GND.\n10k external pull-ups provided; verify onboard encoder pull-ups and LCD I2C pull-ups."
		(at 25.4 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2c9171a6-740e-46e8-b9c4-88c95fdd1867")
	)
	(text "TEST POINTS\nTP1 GND\nTP2 RAW / +8V\nTP3 VCC / +5V\nTP4 PWM\nTP5 filtered tone\nTP6 audio injection\nTP7 PTT sense\nTP8 radio PTT\n\nGND clip access\nneeds PCB review."
		(at 330.2 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b4b2e726-3940-4cdf-b9bc-6cf6f135b65b")
	)
	(text "IC-229H CTCSS INTERFACE - 5V PRO MICRO / 151.4 Hz"
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9f660398-c09c-410f-997b-7237a66aaedb")
	)
	(text "Schematic capture complete. CNC / assembly / radio bench acceptance still required; see implementation notes."
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bd9a7321-561f-4a4b-809b-2adb205ac022")
	)
	(text "TONE LEVEL\n3296W-1-103LF\nClockwise increases.\nStart fully CCW."
		(at 174 120.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d12507f1-4369-4bcf-9b07-fc4590ecd452")
	)
	(text "MODULE: user-approved nominal Biacco42 pad map, 2.54mm pitch / 15.24mm rows.\nCNC derivative retains all 24 centers; enlarged B.Cu pads. Mount in female sockets.\nReserve USB-C / clone / cable access; verify physical fit before soldering.\nDo not connect radio power and USB simultaneously until module power paths are verified."
		(at 165.1 153.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "09f8a970-3a4d-4ee1-84c8-b06095b37e42")
	)
	(text "IMPLEMENTATION / BRING-UP\nBypass disables tone; PTT depends on powered, functioning firmware (firmware out of scope).\nCNC: 1.5mm single-sided blank; bottom copper only; no planes/vias/jumpers. Physical marking may be external.\nRadio wiring/current, LCD/backlight load, onboard I2C pull-ups, deviation and PWM noise require bench checks.\nUse current-limited supply, inspect shorts and socket orientation, then insert module with power off."
		(at 25.4 245.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ae11ec9b-69be-49a4-9292-8be6f0d54665")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAGs declare external\nradio +8V and GND source.\n+5V source is U1 VCC."
		(at 330.2 76.2 0)
		(effects
