  (text "PTT SENSE / DRIVER: default PTT released during reset.\nQ1 onsemi 2N3904TAR, factory-formed 2.54mm leads; E=1, B=2, C=3.\nInitial sink target <=5mA; verify actual radio voltage/current and saturation."
    (at 165.1 20.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6ac3f764-55c2-4b77-aa6f-316632d7a067")
  )
  (text "SUPPLY: +8V directly to U1 RAW; U1 VCC supplies +5V.\nC4 RAW decoupling; C5 +5V decoupling; C6 4.7uF TDK film, 15mm pitch.\nC3 1uF KEMET film, 5mm pitch. Both film capacitors nonpolar, 63V."
    (at 25.4 140.97 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6a61a956-b0c6-4001-b057-9d6f20429482")
  )
